  "5. Instructions": [
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "STEP 1: UPDATE MASTER TRACKER"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• Go to '1. Master Tracker' sheet"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• This is YOUR internal record of vendor access (source of truth)"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• Add/update user records as you grant or revoke access"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• Use the dropdown in 'Access Status' column (Pending/Active/Revoked/Expired)"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "STEP 2: PASTE VENDOR REPORT"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• Go to '2. Vendor Report' sheet"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• Paste the access report provided by your vendor"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• Make sure columns align: Vendor, User Name, Email, Role, Access Status, etc."
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• Keep the same number of rows as Master Tracker for accurate comparison"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "STEP 3: REVIEW RECONCILIATION REPORT"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• Go to '3. Reconciliation Report' sheet"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• This sheet AUTOMATICALLY compares Master vs Vendor data using formulas"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• Look for rows with '✗ Mismatch' in 'Status Match?' or 'Role Match?' columns"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• 'Discrepancy Type' column shows what doesn't match"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• 'Action Required' column suggests next steps"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "STEP 4: CHECK SUMMARY DASHBOARD"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• Go to '4. Summary Dashboard' sheet"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• View overall reconciliation metrics"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• See total matches, mismatches, and reconciliation rate"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• Review discrepancies broken down by vendor"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "STEP 5: RESOLVE DISCREPANCIES"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• For each mismatch, investigate with the vendor"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• Update either Master Tracker or ask vendor to correct their records"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• Add notes in the 'Notes' column of Reconciliation Report"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• Re-run comparison after updates"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "KEY FORMULAS USED:"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• Status Match: =IF(Master_Status=Vendor_Status,'✓ Match','✗ Mismatch')"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• Role Match: =IF(Master_Role=Vendor_Role,'✓ Match','✗ Mismatch')"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• Discrepancy Type: Identifies whether status or role doesn't match"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "• Summary metrics: COUNT and COUNTIF formulas to calculate totals"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "TIPS:"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "✓ Update Master Tracker regularly as access changes"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "✓ Request vendor reports weekly or monthly for reconciliation"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "✓ Focus on 'Active' users first — ensure they should have access"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "✓ Investigate 'Revoked' mismatches — security risk if vendor still shows Active"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "✓ Use filters in Reconciliation Report to view only mismatches"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "SUPPORT:"
    },
    {
      "HOW TO USE THIS RECONCILIATION TRACKER": "For questions about vendor access management:"
    },
    {
